<title>USA: Option Care buys medical equipment firm.</title>
<headline>Option Care buys medical equipment firm.</headline>
<dateline>BANNOCKBURN, Ill. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Option Care Inc said Tuesday it acquired Grand Medical Supply Inc, a home medical equipment company located in Grand Junction, Colo.</p>
<p>The transaction was structured as an asset purchase. Terms were not given.</p>
<p>Grand Medical had revenues of approximately $1.0 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Option Care is a full service home healthcare provider with a national network of 184 franchised and company-owned locations.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
